# Review policy for this repository:
# - Dependency PRs from .github/workflows/deps-autoupdate.yml merge themselves
#   once every update group passed build + e2e inside that workflow. Those get
#   no human review, by design.
# - Everything else, workflow changes included, is expected to go through
#   human review by the owner below.
#
# This file only requests reviews. It becomes an actual gate when branch
# protection enables "Require review from Code Owners" — which would also
# block the bot's auto-merge above; the two policies cannot both be on.

* @dayjournal

# Kept separate: workflow changes are the most security-sensitive files here.
.github/workflows/* @dayjournal
